          "sanitizer_analysis": "No sanitization, escaping, quoting, or allow-listing exists anywhere in the 17-line repository. The name value is concatenated directly into a shell command string in service.py:4 and passed to /bin/sh -c in worker.py:4. The surrounding double quotes in the printf template do not protect against shell metacharacters such as \", ;, $(), backticks, or newlines, which break out of the quoted context.",
